{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1396091-sybyllant-tongue-voices-of-the-unchained","id":1396091,"title":"Sybyllant Tongue: Voices of the Unchained","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-12T18:23:19-07:00","id":1396091,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Sybyllant Tongue: Voices of the Unchained","content":"I was listening to/watching <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q2yzTcdPapQ\" target=\"_blank\"><u><i><b>this</b></i></u></a> here video, when, for some inexplicable contrivance of my own demented mind, I recalled <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/183474-what-does-your-demonic-form-look-like\">this here thread</a>, and a question popped into my mind; could these be what the voices of at least some of the Unchained sound like? And so I seek to learn how each of you imagine the voice of your Unchained's Demonic Form. You can be as loose-lipped or strapped-tongued about the details as you want, as flowery or bland as your heart desires. All I ask for is the most accurate 'depiction' of your character's true voice as you like, though you don't have to describe it if you don't want to, or just haven't put in the thought.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","titl